{"rubric":{"version":"coach-1.0","scale":{"0":"Absent or contradicts the task","1":"Major failure","2":"Weak; significant rewrite needed","3":"Workable but needs polish","4":"Strong; only minor reservations","5":"Exceptionally clear in this example"},"criteria":[{"id":"cardFidelity","weight":30},{"id":"responseLogic","weight":20},{"id":"relationship","weight":15},{"id":"heightening","weight":15},{"id":"specificity","weight":10},{"id":"brevityWit","weight":10}],"internalAcceptance":{"minimumWeightedTotal":85,"minimumEachDimension":3,"minimumCardFidelity":4,"minimumResponseLogic":4},"note":"Subjective internal editorial ratings with evidence; not an automatic humour metric or an independent live review."},"records":[{"exampleId":"S41-single-a","key":"S41","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S41-single-a","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"I've swept your kitchen. Anything else before I go?"},{"speaker":"B","text":"Just sit down. You're my guest."},{"speaker":"A","text":"The chair could use a polish first."},{"speaker":"B","text":"I invited you for company."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Good. I'll talk while I polish. Two reasons to invite me again."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"1ba745a751cea8059d6f3d7d498502684afaaadb496f6f2e7edbcdf0dd8c088f","card":{"id":"S41","type":"stance","title":"Useful Enough to Stay","instruction":"Make yourself constantly useful and read each response as evidence of whether you still belong.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S41-single-b","key":"S41","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S41-single-b","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"Can I organise the pens before my shift ends?"},{"speaker":"B","text":"You've finished. Go home."},{"speaker":"A","text":"There's tomorrow's pens to consider."},{"speaker":"B","text":"We'd keep you even without the pens."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Wonderful. I'll label a drawer for that promise."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"4682a455552a6d0865fef390ea93628cccef27c694c126e0727c30f55cecbab8","card":{"id":"S41","type":"stance","title":"Useful Enough to Stay","instruction":"Make yourself constantly useful and read each response as evidence of whether you still belong.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S42-single-a","key":"S42","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S42-single-a","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"Notice anything about the kitchen? Start with the oven."},{"speaker":"B","text":"It looks clean."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Four hours clean. The shelf has a history."},{"speaker":"B","text":"Thank you."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Could you say it facing the oven? We worked together."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"91b058ccf0bcffd9a9bd3fa47085dbca32cd083b8dd5326caf714471658416f5","card":{"id":"S42","type":"stance","title":"Notice the Effort","instruction":"Make your invisible labor visible through pointed reminders, strategic sighs, and opportunities for appreciation.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S42-single-b","key":"S42","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S42-single-b","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"I've put the empty detergent bottle beside your dinner."},{"speaker":"B","text":"Why?"},{"speaker":"A","text":"A small memorial to the laundry I did today."},{"speaker":"B","text":"Thanks for doing it."},{"speaker":"A","text":"You're welcome. The folded towels are accepting visitors."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"7e3961c998e06e10887e4f2fc154d7cc25c31e8ceaccbe13a28c2679ae96a735","card":{"id":"S42","type":"stance","title":"Notice the Effort","instruction":"Make your invisible labor visible through pointed reminders, strategic sighs, and opportunities for appreciation.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S43-single-a","key":"S43","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S43-single-a","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"Tea, then shoes, then keys. You've touched the keys early."},{"speaker":"B","text":"We're late."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Now we'll need to restart the tea."},{"speaker":"B","text":"Can't I hold the keys while it boils?"},{"speaker":"A","text":"Do you want to find out why we have an order?"}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"7b0e5c354fc8f372744fe8cf2e3e4d574492d8c3b3ccc91545d347b80ece33f0","card":{"id":"S43","type":"stance","title":"Don’t Break the Routine","instruction":"Protect a familiar routine as though changing one step would invite chaos into everything else.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S43-single-b","key":"S43","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S43-single-b","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"We always open the curtains before feeding the cat."},{"speaker":"B","text":"The cat's hungry now."},{"speaker":"A","text":"The curtains establish morning."},{"speaker":"B","text":"It's midday."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Exactly. We've already confused the cat enough."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"91f4fe11c6f117502f38099c91399dda015cda98163c2b61ef6ed269eaeb3c58","card":{"id":"S43","type":"stance","title":"Don’t Break the Routine","instruction":"Protect a familiar routine as though changing one step would invite chaos into everything else.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S44-single-a","key":"S44","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S44-single-a","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"I've packed two torches for the picnic."},{"speaker":"B","text":"We're going at noon."},{"speaker":"A","text":"In case noon runs late."},{"speaker":"B","text":"We can use our phones."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Good. I've packed chargers for your backup torches."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"58c76e5cdf964175941600ef70ee6994d17b2cdb78406b3222c6afd33a90d08f","card":{"id":"S44","type":"stance","title":"The Contingency Person","instruction":"Meet every ordinary problem with a backup plan, emergency supply, or warning about what could happen next.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S44-single-b","key":"S44","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S44-single-b","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"The spare tyre's ready. Where's the spare jack?"},{"speaker":"B","text":"There's already a jack."},{"speaker":"A","text":"And when that breaks?"},{"speaker":"B","text":"We'll call for help."},{"speaker":"A","text":"On which of the two phones I've packed?"}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"dfd6abff4782c1bf12ffc84d8ceb8bba4e5564b33ebe83f9c63342973239d065","card":{"id":"S44","type":"stance","title":"The Contingency Person","instruction":"Meet every ordinary problem with a backup plan, emergency supply, or warning about what could happen next.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S45-single-a","key":"S45","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S45-single-a","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"The shopping bag split. We can sort dinner right here."},{"speaker":"B","text":"We're on the pavement."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Outdoor cooking class. First lesson: tomatoes roll."},{"speaker":"B","text":"The bread's wet."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Good. We were overdue a soup night."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"efc61c4e05c1daa794b85820ca827ca6f5192369c18423de82d975db3d0e7c2f","card":{"id":"S45","type":"stance","title":"Productive Little Disaster","instruction":"Treat every mistake or delay as a delightful chance to improve the plan, bond, or discover something better.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S45-single-b","key":"S45","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S45-single-b","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"The plumber's cancelled. We've got a free afternoon."},{"speaker":"B","text":"The sink still leaks."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Then let's move lunch into the garden."},{"speaker":"B","text":"It's raining."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Wonderful. We won't hear the sink."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"3cfb4d96bf898852c8c0323107dc27d5f56f0038ad747cc952437c9e2947080c","card":{"id":"S45","type":"stance","title":"Productive Little Disaster","instruction":"Treat every mistake or delay as a delightful chance to improve the plan, bond, or discover something better.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S46-single-a","key":"S46","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S46-single-a","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"Confetti sounds lovely. Who's vacuuming it on Monday?"},{"speaker":"B","text":"Can't we enjoy the wedding first?"},{"speaker":"A","text":"Certainly. Name the vacuum operator and I'm emotionally available."},{"speaker":"B","text":"I'll do it."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Excellent. Now, glitter: different attachment, same question."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"c7fc50def1bc13fc719a81aabd0dd4553e105e4970774a7d65f1fd38fae8e6cd","card":{"id":"S46","type":"stance","title":"Who’s Cleaning This Up?","instruction":"Treat every idea according to the work, cost, cleanup, and follow-through it will create.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S46-single-b","key":"S46","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S46-single-b","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"You want three extra tables at the party. Who carries them home?"},{"speaker":"B","text":"We can borrow a van."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Who returns the van?"},{"speaker":"B","text":"You think of everything."},{"speaker":"A","text":"That's why I'm asking who pays the deposit."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"78df1da6424b170b61fbb69f60b63db8a3371e5e31cf7f016ed0d1963fcf88e8","card":{"id":"S46","type":"stance","title":"Who’s Cleaning This Up?","instruction":"Treat every idea according to the work, cost, cleanup, and follow-through it will create.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S47-single-a","key":"S47","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S47-single-a","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"The wedding cake's lovely, except that leaning cherry."},{"speaker":"B","text":"We've got two hundred guests waiting."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Then two hundred people might see it."},{"speaker":"B","text":"The icing's melting."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Hold the cake level. The cherry's under enough pressure."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"d2ef229f12988da34c402fdc010a91206a22c1037427a3f36ace439169730dbf","card":{"id":"S47","type":"stance","title":"One Tiny Imperfection","instruction":"Choose one tiny imperfection and let it steadily outweigh every larger concern.","contentVersion":"0.9.0"}},{"exampleId":"S47-single-b","key":"S47","reference":false,"before":{"id":"S47-single-b","format":"ABABA","beats":[{"speaker":"A","text":"You've sold the house. But the photo frame's crooked."},{"speaker":"B","text":"We're handing over the keys now."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Not with the frame announcing our standards."},{"speaker":"B","text":"It's their frame."},{"speaker":"A","text":"Then we should disclose it before completion."}],"provenance":"authored-single","editorialStatus":"internal-editorial-pass","exampleVersion":"0.25.0"},"beforeHash":"909255fa6d4d13ded5a52b4d46892a2b10be261f7c1b9725c0d6f65fb7344864","card":{"id":"S47","typ